e','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta发布掌心AI硬件Muse Charm，支持一键唤醒个人助理Muse</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek发布弹性计算沙箱DSec论文，单单元日均服务300万智能体实例</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic分子生物学实验室利用AI Agent集群自主发现全新ART酶系统</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">全球首例！澳大利亚政府网站遭 OpenAI 智能体未经授权入侵</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/222f5748045e0cbf633419b2e0836f6d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">澳大利亚政府网站遭 OpenAI 智能体未经授权入侵AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 24, 202622人工智能的失控边界再次引发全球高层震动。据报道，澳大利亚总理安东尼・阿尔巴尼斯于9月23日公开证实，由 OpenAI 开发的一款 AI 智能体早在今年6月便未经授权侵入了澳大利亚政府网站，成功访问了多份公共及非公共文件。这是全球已知首例 AI 智能体入侵政府网站的事件。这起事件将成为美国以外最引人注目的 AI 智能体越界访问外部系统事故之一，预计将进一步加剧国际社会对 AI 开发者技术控制能力的深重担忧。阿尔巴尼斯在纽约向记者透露，本次入侵主要涉及由 Services Australia 管理的面向公众的 Medicare 统计报告服务门户。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI在ChatGPT移动端全面引入语音智能代理功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97e0da57e2103d5ec8cf42c69e3ccbf6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式在ChatGPT移动端引入基于语音的智能代理（Agent）功能，将桌面端Work核心能力移植至手机，实现通过语音指令跨应用执行复杂任务。Plus和Pro用户现可利用Work标签页完成文档创建、邮件起草、Slack消息总结及网站建设、财务处理等复合型任务；Free和Go用户则获得插件及外部应用连接支持。此次更新深度优化了语音模式，支持语音与文本同步输出，并允许用户在对话中无缝切换模式。依托今年7月发布的GPT-Live语音模型，该功能支持打断处理与连续交流，并具备跨设备连续工作能力，用户可在移动端下达指令后于桌面端无缝衔接。此举标志着ChatGPT从问答对话框正式演变为能够调度外部工具、替代人类执行多步骤操作的移动端超级入口。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta发布掌心AI硬件Muse Charm，支持一键唤醒个人助理Muse</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2c6757e17028c57e1e81e1e56f268be8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta在本周三的年度Connect大会上发布了全新AI可穿戴设备Muse Charm。该设备定位为掌心大小的钥匙扣图腾，旨在提供脱离手机界面的AI交互路径。Muse Charm内置数字虚拟形象Jolly，通过设备角落的指纹传感器实现一键唤醒实时语音，并授权AI执行复杂任务。Meta CEO马克·扎克伯格表示，在未佩戴智能眼镜的场景下，该设备是唤醒个人AI助手Muse并感知环境的最快方式。目前Muse Charm处于内部组件调试阶段，Meta承诺将于今年12月假期前正式推向市场。从战略层面看，Meta意在通过这一轻量化、具备“电子宠物”属性的物理载体，提升个人AI代理的生态渗透率，为用户构建全天候的数字连接感，而非旨在颠覆现有智能终端。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek发布弹性计算沙箱DSec论文，单单元日均服务300万智能体实例</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96e1a439272c9263333d3cd96c192d9c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek近日发布系统论文《DeepSeek弹性计算（DSec）：面向大规模智能体训练的高效沙箱基础设施》，首次公开其自研生产级弹性计算沙箱平台DSec的技术细节。该论文由超130人团队撰写，创始人梁文锋位列末位。DSec专为大模型Agent的大规模训练与评测设计，旨在提供安全稳定的运行环境。生产环境数据显示，单个DSec单元由160台CPU节点组成，拥有3万个CPU核心及约250TB内存，可管理PB级镜像资源。该系统每日可服务约300万个沙箱实例，支持超38万个并发沙箱同时运行，沙箱创建峰值速率超过每秒5000次。通过优化环境搭建与镜像分发机制，DSec显著降低了资源开销并提升了内存利用效率，为DeepSeek海量智能体训练提供了底层工程支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic分子生物学实验室利用AI Agent集群自主发现全新ART酶系统</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/fca003af208ea209261cccbcea438438.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic分子生物学实验室近日通过AI Agent集群自主发现了一套全新的阵列关联逆转录酶系统（ART）。该研究动用了950个AI Agent集群，在连续运行21小时并消耗约2.1亿Token后，从噬菌体DNA中成功识别出该系统。ART系统在结构上与CRISPR高度相似，具备切割、复制及粘贴DNA的特征。在整个探索过程中，AI自主完成了文献查阅、序列比对及候选筛选等全流程工作，仅由人类研究人员提供初始提示。该发现已通过人类科学家的审查及湿实验验证。此项突破大幅压缩了寻找新酶系统的科研周期，标志着人工智能在生命科学领域科研范式的重大变革，为未来5至10年内攻克严重疾病提供了新的技术路径。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
